  "caveats": [
    "Actual pinned model inference on a public photograph, not fake landmarks. No camera sensor or owner footage was acquired.",
    "Direct bitmap excludes physical sensor/video ingestion, optical NCC, full application UI/readiness/arbitration, display compositor/panel and human pointing intent.",
    "A fresh <=150ms packet may arrive >150ms after an earlier scene motion onset at a low cap. No freshness threshold changed.",
    "GPU startup8110.4ms exceeded the current optional8s fallback timer in this routed benchmark, although below total15s. Production may choose CPU; this is not proof GPU would be selected.",
    "Concurrent gaming/dependency preparation load was preserved. Two repeats and12steps per cap do not establish a causal cap-tail ranking or backend-only comparison with historicalCPU data.",
    "A raw photo-translation8pixel band is not the independent3percent calibrated screen-accuracy requirement or physical recognition proof.",
    "All negative/blank and late outputs remain in packet denominators; first/second confirmation times are distinct.",
    "No images, raw landmarks, source coordinates, private capture paths, account/camera/track/device identifiers are included in this aggregate."
  ]
